The parent residual has frequencies at most $4\mathsf D$. Bernstein’s inequality (B.1) therefore gives the hypothesis of (5.7) with $A_f=\|R_U\|_{C_tL^\infty}$. By (5.6) the force that the first mean must cancel satisfies, for every $n\ge0$, $$\begin{equation}
