     \mu\varepsilon_\Lambda\le9\mu\lambda^{5(2-P)+4(P+1)}
     \le\lambda^{15-P}
     =\lambda^{15}\lambda_{j+1}^{-6}\le\lambda_{j+1}^{-5}. \tag{7.12}
    \end{equation}$$ In particular $C_{2,P}\varepsilon_\Lambda\le\lambda_{j+1}^{-5}$.

